      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The source uses a layered validation strategy: rigorous second-moment agreement checks the shifted pole package at k=1, Motohashi's exact fourth-moment decomposition checks the recipe's six-term residual main-term organization at k=2, and larger numerical panels test the full lower-order polynomials rather than leading degree alone because attainable conductors make lower coefficients and rare large values materially visible.",
